# Derived data and the built page must hash the same on every OS.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.woff2 binary

# The derived data file (~35 MB, rewritten by every refresh) lives in Git LFS so the
# repository's history doesn't grow by a full copy each week. See docs/DECISIONS.md.
data/drugs.json filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
